    "Hi, I'm [Kurtis](https://github.com/kguy18). I build Baby Buddy Companion in my free time, and it's [open source on GitHub](https://github.com/kguy18/babybuddyios). It's free, and [supporters like you](babybuddy://supporter) keep it going.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi, I'm [Kurtis](https://github.com/kguy18). I build Baby Buddy Companion in my free time, and it's [open source on GitHub](https://github.com/kguy18/babybuddyios). It's free, and [supporters like you](babybuddy://supporter) keep it going."
          }
        },
        "de-DE": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hallo, ich bin [Kurtis](https://github.com/kguy18). Ich entwickle Baby Buddy Companion in meiner Freizeit. Der [Quellcode ist auf GitHub verfügbar](https://github.com/kguy18/babybuddyios). Die App ist kostenlos und [Menschen wie du](babybuddy://supporter) unterstützen ihre Weiterentwicklung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
