            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the app helps, you can support its development."
          }
        },
        "de-DE": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn die App dir hilft, kannst du ihre Entwicklung unterstützen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this %@ was already saved when the timer was stopped, you'll end up with two copies. Check the server first if you're unsure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If this %@ was already saved when the timer was stopped, you'll end up with two copies. Check the server first if you're unsure."
          }
        },
        "de-DE": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Falls dieser Eintrag (%@) beim Stoppen des Timers bereits gespeichert wurde, entstehen zwei Kopien. Prüfe bei Unsicherheit zuerst den Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Cloudflare Zero Trust, create a **service token**. Copy the Client ID and Client Secret. The secret is shown only once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Cloudflare Zero Trust, create a **service token**. Copy the Client ID and Client Secret. The secret is shown only once."
          }
        },
        "de-DE": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erstelle in Cloudflare Zero Trust einen **Service-Token**. Kopiere Client-ID und Client-Secret. Das Secret wird nur einmal angezeigt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
